# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Architectural recap:
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#   random             → Layer 3: trivial baseline
#   round-robin        → Layer 3: state-blind heuristic
#   shortest-queue     → Layer 3: queue-aware heuristic
#   SECT               → Layer 3: class-aware heuristic
#   fluid-LP           → Layer 3: simplex / interior-point on the fluid relaxation
#   MDP-VI             → Layer 3 ∘ Layer 2: value iteration on the empirical MDP whose transitions came from DES rollouts
#   MCTS               → Layer 3 ∘ Layer 1: tree search using DES as the rollout oracle

#   The same DES (`simulateDispatch`) evaluates EVERY policy.
#   The MDP-VI policy uses the DES as its transition oracle.
#   The MCTS policy uses the DES as its rollout simulator.
#   The fluid-LP policy is a randomised assignment from the LP relaxation,
#     which the simplex / interior-point of choice solves in milliseconds.

